  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0020_9786dcc1006d.png\" style=\"width:1.62708in;height:0.7in\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></menclose></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></menclose><mo>-</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></menclose><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(always true)<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn></menclose><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn></menclose><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;...(i)<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;...(ii)<br />Taking intersection of (i) and (ii), we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
